# Atlas knowledge sync

When changing visitor-facing facts about Roy (About copy, bio, projects, experience, education, location, availability, tools, certifications, or similar), update `app/lib/atlasKnowledge.ts` in the **same** change.

- Atlas injects that string as its source of truth; site UI and Atlas must not drift.
- Do not leave Atlas updates as a follow-up unless the user asks to skip them.
- Prefer concise factual bullets that match the new site wording.
